WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.168
The sun was up.

2
00:00:16.169 --> 00:00:27.775
The sky was blue.

3
00:00:27.776 --> 00:00:31.485
Cat said, "I can jump.

4
00:00:31.486 --> 00:00:36.078
I can jump over the gate.

5
00:00:36.079 --> 00:00:44.794
Watch me jump!"

6
00:00:44.795 --> 00:00:47.759
Bat said, "I can fly.

7
00:00:47.761 --> 00:00:50.803
I can fly over the tree.

8
00:00:50.804 --> 00:01:04.387
Watch me fly!"

9
00:01:04.388 --> 00:01:07.658
Cow said, "I can walk.

10
00:01:07.659 --> 00:01:14.139
I can walk around the well.

11
00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:19.542
And I can make a wish!"

12
00:01:19.543 --> 00:01:23.850
"A wish?" said Bat.

13
00:01:23.851 --> 00:01:26.410
"I want to make a wish!"

14
00:01:26.411 --> 00:01:30.226
"So do I!" said Cat.

15
00:01:30.227 --> 00:01:33.759
Cow said, "You can make a wish.

16
00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:39.110
I will help you."

17
00:01:39.111 --> 00:01:49.564
Cat and Bat went to the well.

18
00:01:49.565 --> 00:01:53.876
"How do we make a wish?" said Cat.

19
00:01:53.877 --> 00:01:56.920
"Watch me," said Cow.

20
00:01:56.921 --> 00:02:01.630
"I will show you what to do!"

